# M9 — DAILY ice fields, for the partition-imprint test.
#
# The concern this serves: under the delayed halo exchange the stale values sit exactly on the
# sub-domain rim, and the partition is static, so any error is re-injected at the same nodes
# every step. Monthly means average over 30 days of that and can hide a coherent imprint;
# daily fields show it forming (or not) and can be animated.
#
# Ice only, and no 3-D fields: 60 daily records of the 3-D ocean would be ~100 GB per leg and
# nothing here reads them.
a_ice,m_ice,m_snow,uice,vice    daily
